1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/rust-02-closure","children":["Rust 入门丨02 闭包"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/rust-02-closure.jpg","alt":"Rust 入门丨02 闭包 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"rust"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"Rust 入门丨02 闭包"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文通过\"承诺\"的视角深入解析 Rust 闭包中 Fn、FnMut、FnOnce 三个 trait 的包含关系，帮助读者理解闭包设计的本质。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-08T13:22:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/08"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,369"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"笔者之前一直不理解 Rust 中关于闭包的 Fn/FnMut/FnOnce 这 3 个 trait 的包含关系。通过一段时间的学习和分析，终于找到了我思维上的一个错误点 ，特此梳理此文，方便日后查询。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"我之前的理解是这样的："}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Fn 只需要引用，所以要求是最容易满足的。FnMut 需要的是可变引用，所以能满足 FnMut，一定能满足 Fn。FnOnce 需要的是所有权，那都有所有权了 ，&mut 和 & 肯定就不在话下了。所以满足 FnOnce 的，一定是 Fn 和 FnMut。满足 FnMut 的，不一定是 FnOnce，但是一定是 Fn。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["我的错误点在于：在",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"闭包实现者"}],"的角度想\"我拥有什么权限\"。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["正确的思路应该是：",["$","u","u-0",{"children":["站在",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"函数调用者"}],"的角度想\"我得到了什么承诺\""]}],"。这才是 Trait 设计的本质，即是能力的声明，更是限制的承诺。"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"核心关键承诺越强限制越多类型越小","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#核心关键承诺越强限制越多类型越小","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#核心关键承诺越强限制越多类型越小"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"核心关键：承诺越强，限制越多，类型越“小”","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":5,"offset":398},"end":{"line":13,"column":26,"offset":419}}}]},"children":"核心关键：承诺越强，限制越多，类型越“小”"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Fn"}],", ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"FnMut"}],", ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"FnOnce"}]," 这三个 Trait，本质上是闭包对",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"调用者"}],"做出的三种不同强度的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"承诺"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Fn"}]," 的承诺 (最强的承诺)"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"承诺内容"}],"：调用我，只需要对我进行不可变借用 (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"&self"}],")。你甚至可以同时在多个线程里调用我。我保证不会改变任何东西，也不会消耗掉自己。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"对闭包的限制"}],"：为了兑现这个最强的承诺，闭包自身受到的限制也最大。它",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"只能"}],"不可变地借用环境中的变量。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"调用者的自由"}],"：调用者获得了最大的自由，可以随心所欲地、不限次数地调用这个闭包。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"FnMut"}]," 的承诺 (中等的承诺)"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"承诺内容"}],"：调用我，需要对我进行可变借用 (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"&mut self"}],")。这意味着你不能同时调用我，但可以一个接一个地调用。我可能会改变我内部的状态。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"对闭包的限制"}],"：限制有所放宽。闭包可以",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"可变地"}],"借用环境变量。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"调用者的自由"}],"：调用者的自由受到了一些限制，不能并发调用了。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"FnOnce"}]," 的承诺 (最弱的承诺)"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"承诺内容"}],"：你","$L8","调用我一次 (","$L9",")。调用之后，我就会被消耗掉，不复存在。"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17"]}]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}],"$L1b"]}]]}]}]
